/* The top left is whose product this is, and this is Citrus's. The club
   mark has not gone anywhere: it leads the score bug directly below, every
   one of the thirteen page headers, and every row of the locker room. That
   is the right division. Sleeper does not put your club's crest where its
   own name goes. */
